cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Humanoid Market 2026: an open dataset on shipments, valuations and disclosure (Physical AI, by the Numbers #1)"
abstract: >-
  Source-cited dataset on the humanoid robot market: units shipped, financing rounds and
  valuations, revenue, sector venture funding, published forecasts, prices and costs, public
  evidence of robots doing useful work, line items quoted verbatim from company filings, a
  valuation-per-robot metric and a disclosure scorecard of what each humanoid maker discloses.
  Every value cites a public source; currency conversions use Federal Reserve H.10 rates.
  Data cut-off: 2026-10-12.
authors:
  - family-names: "Loarte Susano"
    given-names: "Carlos"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cloarte/humanoid-market-2026"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
keywords:
  - humanoid robots
  - physical AI
  - venture capital
  - disclosure
  - dataset
